{
    "title": "CSL \u2013 Meet, Chat, Pla\u202ay & Date",
    "description": "<h1> <b> CSL is the first free dating app created specifically for you to meet people while playing. </b> </h1>\r\n\r\nWhy does online dating have to be complicated? Just swiping, chatting and matching gets boring fast and rarely results in any dates. It\u2019s time to bring the fun and the play back to dating!\r\n\r\nYou might even have started to think social and dating apps and you are \u201cnot a match\u201d. It\u2019s time you rethink because there\u2019s a new, better, more fun, and playful way to meet new people. Say goodbye to boring dating and explore a new way to get social, meet new people, chat with other singles and set up hangouts or dates with CSL. \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re looking just to meet people nearby, a casual date or a friendly hangout, new friends, a serious or a no-strings-attached relationship, CSL is the perfect way to make new connections and explore new relationships in a playful way and break the ice with fun games! \r\n\r\n<h2> <b> Play games, chat, have casual talks, make friends or find love, get a date and start a relationship \u2764\ufe0f </b> </h2>\r\n\r\nAt CSL, we're changing the way people date - we're the amusement park for online dating and making friends.\r\nSocializing while playing games makes connecting with new people way easier! On CSL, you can break the ice with people nearby and turn strangers into friends in digital hangouts full of fun and play. A Trivia game can be the first step to finding a friend and having real-life hangouts or setting up a date and finding a girlfriend or boyfriend - it\u2019s that simple!  \r\n\r\nIf you have trouble going past the small talk or the initial chat, you can use our games to avoid the awkwardness, move the conversation along and make interaction more fun with the singles you match with. \r\n\r\nNot looking for too much commitment? You can simply play in a casual way, whenever you feel like it! If you happen to click with someone, you can go onto chatting with them using CSL\u2019s private chat. \r\n\r\n<h2> <b> Download CSL, start playing and chatting totally FREE! </b> </h2>\r\n\r\nMeet, match, talk, play, flirt, date, hang\u2026 Whatever your social goal is, you can have for free at CSL! We are a no-strings-attached app - you don\u2019t need any payment or subscription to use CSL\u2019s main features. Just set up your profile and start matching and playing.  \r\n\r\nFeel like you want to give a boost to your chances of finding your next date or casual hangout? \r\nThere\u2019s a **VIP option** with a bunch of fun features, that\u2019ll allow you to make the most of your social experience on CSL: \r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0fNo ads\r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0fBe the first to see new users\r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0fSee your likes and get a second chance on swiping\r\n\r\nOn CSL, you decide the experience you want to have, with full flexibility and no hidden costs. \r\nWhatever you\u2019re looking for, we put you in touch with people nearby who want the same thing, for free. Using CSL to get social and start new relationships couldn\u2019t be a simpler affair - so it\u2019s time to download! \r\n\r\n<h2> <b> Be part of a community \u2764\ufe0f </b> </h2>\r\nWe do not accept judgments, bullying or the culture of toxic relationships. No matter who you are, where you come from, if you are gay, lesbian or straight - or even curious! -, on CSL you can explore, meet new open-minded people and be sure everyone is free to express themselves.\r\nOver 50 million singles already meet and play for free on CSL! Build a social network of new adult friends, build casual or deep relationships, have casual friendly hangouts or set up a date, chase love and find romance.\r\n\r\n<h2> <b> Meet people safely and worry-free </b> </h2>\r\n\r\nCSL is free, safe, and secure. We work every day to keep our community free from fake profiles and scams, so you can just focus on being social. What are you waiting for? Join us now, meet, play, and schedule hangouts with new people in a fun way.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Follow us and stay up to date:\r\n\r\nFor more information, read our Privacy Policy and Conditions of Use:\r\n[https://joyridedating.com/privacy](https://joyridedating.com/privacy)[https://joyridedating.com/terms](https://joyridedating.com/terms)",
